## EFC_BRAIN_LMHEAD_001

```yaml
efc_id:    "EFC_BRAIN_LMHEAD_001"
rfn:       "RFN://brain.candle.lmhead"
file:      "fem/hacedle/src/x/provider/candle/lmhead.rs (3.12KB)"
status:    PARTIAL
priority:  CRITICAL  # THIS is the logits source for G7

input:     "hidden: Vec<f32>[hidden_size]  (last transformer layer output)"
output:    "logits: Vec<f32>[vocab_size]   e.g. [151936] for Qwen2.5"

process: |
  1. final_rmsnorm(hidden, rms_weight)
  2. matmul(hidden, lm_head_weight[vocab_size x hidden])
  -> logits[vocab_size]

weight_source:
  norm:    "GGUF tensor: 'output_norm.weight' (shape [hidden_size])"
  lmhead:  "GGUF tensor: 'output.weight' (shape [vocab_size, hidden_size])"
           # Qwen2.5 may share 'token_embd.weight' â€” check tied_embeddings flag

gap: |
  LmHead::forward() likely structurally correct.
  Gap: HacedleKernel.forward() in kernel/hacedle.rs must:
    1. Run all layers (call layer.forward() in loop 0..block_count)
    2. Call lmhead.forward() on final hidden state
    3. Return logits Vec<f32>
  Currently: kernel/hacedle.rs = skeleton, forward() not calling any of this.
```

