## Wiring diagram (target)

```text
InferenceEngine::infer(req)                 [brain/master/src/inference/engine.rs]
  |
  +-- GgufLoader::load(model_path)          [delegates to hacedle loader_std]
  |     -> LoadedModel
  |
  +-- BrainTokenizer::encode(text)          [brain/master/src/tokenizer/]
  |     -> token_ids: Vec<u32>
  |
  +-- KvCache::new(model_spec, max_seq)     [brain/master/src/runtime/kv_cache.rs]
  |     -> kv: KvCache
  |
  +-- HacedleKernel::forward(              [brain/master/src/kernel/hacedle.rs]
  |       token_ids, &model, &mut kv)       |
  |     |                                   v
  |     +-- CandleInferenceEngine::forward  [hacedle/x/provider/candle/inference.rs]
  |           embed -> layer[0..n] -> lmhead
  |     -> logits: Vec<f32>[vocab_size]
  |
  +-- Logits::top_k(logits, k=5)           [brain/master/src/runtime/logits.rs]
        -> Vec<(token_id, score)>
```
